    <aboutText>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[At Centro, we revolutionize business operations through world-class BPO services and cutting-edge technology solutions. Focused on efficiency, scalability, and innovation, we help organizations streamline processes, enhance performance, and drive sustainable growth. With deep industry expertise, advanced technology, and an unwavering commitment to operational excellence, we deliver customized outsourcing solutions that elevate customer experiences, optimize workflows, and unlock business potential. Our approach is rooted in precision, accountability, and innovation, ensuring seamless integration with our clients' operations. More than just an outsourcing provider, we are a strategic partner—empowering businesses to adapt, grow, and lead in an ever-evolving market.]]></Value>
    </aboutText>
    <aboutTitle>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[About Centro]]></Value>
    </aboutTitle>
